      "writtenOn": "2021-02-24T22:34:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hm. In spec, diagram trumps text. Underneath \"Figure 8-76 Sink Port State Diagram\", Note 7, it says:\n\n\u003e 7 To be sent once, and only required if Fast Role Swap is supported by the Sink.\n\nReading that strictly, that implies one attempt (with retries) every time you enter the SNK_READY bubble.\n\nDeferring to Diana here, but \"strictly per spec\" you may be right it is required every time.\n\nThis may have to do with the fact it cannot be spontaneously generated by the device itself -- hence the requirement to be constantly refreshed.",
      "parentUuid": "da12c620_229f328e",
